WEBVTT

00:09.759 --> 00:10.635
Assholes!

00:10.719 --> 00:12.554
Stop fucking running!

00:12.637 --> 00:14.556
- Run, Jun-tae-ya!
- Fuckers!

00:15.473 --> 00:16.766
Hey, you fucking pricks!

00:16.850 --> 00:18.518
You have to stop sometime, shits!

00:18.601 --> 00:21.896
- We're gonna catch you!
- You fucking bitches!

00:21.980 --> 00:23.231
Get back here!

00:23.314 --> 00:25.442
- Hey, I said stop!
- Hurry!

00:25.525 --> 00:28.236
- Fuck. Stop, you motherfuckers!
- You can't run forever!

00:28.319 --> 00:29.404
Hurry up.

00:29.487 --> 00:31.698
- What the fuck? Where'd they go?
- Where…

00:31.781 --> 00:33.950
- What the fuck?
- Where the fuck are they?

00:34.034 --> 00:36.036
- What the fuck?
- Sons of bitches!

00:36.119 --> 00:38.621
The three of you, that way.
And we'll go that way. Hurry up.

00:38.705 --> 00:40.665
- Got it, let's go. Hurry.
- Move it!

00:40.749 --> 00:43.334
- Fucking pain in my ass!
- Fucking dead, assholes!

00:47.714 --> 00:49.299
- Jun-tae.
- Huh?

00:49.382 --> 00:50.717
That was a good call, hiding here.

00:51.760 --> 00:55.889
Yeah, it… it always is
the greatest place to hide from bullies.

00:55.972 --> 00:56.848
Nice.

00:58.099 --> 00:59.934
Thanks. Oh!

01:00.560 --> 01:02.020
Oh. The list.

01:02.103 --> 01:03.354
Did you grab it?

01:03.438 --> 01:04.397
Yes.

01:07.734 --> 01:09.569
You better not lose it, okay?

01:09.652 --> 01:12.363
- Yeah.
- Good job. Nice. Freakin' awesome.

01:14.324 --> 01:16.534
Jun-tae-ya!

01:16.618 --> 01:18.787
Little shit! Fucker.

01:20.997 --> 01:22.373
Damn it!

01:23.416 --> 01:24.667
Shit!

01:33.093 --> 01:34.302
Come here!

01:38.431 --> 01:40.266
What's this?

01:42.852 --> 01:45.146
Drop it. I said fucking drop it!

01:45.230 --> 01:48.024
Fuck.

01:49.109 --> 01:50.360
You caught me off guard before.

02:06.960 --> 02:09.170
You fucking little dumbass.

02:09.254 --> 02:10.922
You can't do shit with it, fucker.

02:20.807 --> 02:22.308
They caught them both.

02:22.392 --> 02:24.602
Those fucking assholes
were wasting our time, man.

02:24.686 --> 02:26.354
I fucking hate them, bro.

02:27.647 --> 02:28.648
Hey.

02:30.650 --> 02:31.860
What the fuck?

02:31.943 --> 02:34.237
Shit. Shit.

03:03.975 --> 03:05.226
Are you insane?

03:06.394 --> 03:07.979
What the fuck are you doing?

03:08.605 --> 03:10.273
You're a part of the Union.

03:14.068 --> 03:15.653
I'm gonna kill you all.

04:19.717 --> 04:21.219
Son of a bitch!

04:26.683 --> 04:27.558
Shit.

04:28.559 --> 04:29.894
Hey, Park Hu-min!

04:30.520 --> 04:32.522
Baku!

04:32.605 --> 04:35.316
Hey, stop it! Come on!

04:35.900 --> 04:37.360
You have to stop!

04:38.069 --> 04:40.196
Hey, Jun-tae-ya! Come help me!

04:42.490 --> 04:45.243
Don't!
Get a fucking hold of yourself!

04:46.035 --> 04:48.288
Snap out of it!

04:50.456 --> 04:51.874
Bro. Stop!

04:53.209 --> 04:57.046
- What? Get your hands off of me!
- Hu-min-a, you need to stop, please!

05:00.591 --> 05:02.135
Shithead.

05:02.218 --> 05:03.845
- Hu-min, please!
- Baku.

05:03.928 --> 05:06.556
Hu-min-a.

05:13.688 --> 05:14.981
It's Si-eun.

05:20.320 --> 05:21.529
Si-eun…

06:01.110 --> 06:04.989
INTENSIVE CARE UNIT

07:04.382 --> 07:07.135
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

08:06.319 --> 08:08.779
Whoa!

08:08.863 --> 08:10.281
Oh!

08:10.364 --> 08:12.074
Don't spit it out.
Don't spit it out!

08:12.158 --> 08:13.784
Hey, Hu-min-a.

08:13.868 --> 08:15.661
- When was this, Baku?
- What?

08:16.662 --> 08:18.498
Hey! Bro!

08:18.998 --> 08:20.416
When did I ever say that?

08:22.043 --> 08:24.921
Oh! Oh, oh! it's hot!

08:25.671 --> 08:27.757
Oh! Water! Water, water,
water, water, water!

08:27.840 --> 08:30.343
Damn! That was hot! Oh!

08:30.426 --> 08:32.428
We had good times too.

08:32.512 --> 08:34.180
Hey, hey, hey.

08:34.263 --> 08:36.182
- Water! Water!
- Hey, don't spit it out!

08:36.265 --> 08:37.517
Don't spit it out.

08:38.100 --> 08:39.435
But you know what?

08:42.980 --> 08:44.649
None of it matters.

08:50.905 --> 08:52.031
In the end,

08:54.033 --> 08:55.826
they'll end up just like we did.

08:59.455 --> 09:00.665
Eventually…

09:02.458 --> 09:03.876
they'll all get hurt

09:05.253 --> 09:06.504
and become…

09:08.506 --> 09:09.632
nothing.

09:16.889 --> 09:18.140
I'm sorry.

09:28.109 --> 09:31.279
I didn't come here
because I wanted you to apologize.

10:19.952 --> 10:21.078
How's Si-eun?

10:25.625 --> 10:27.668
His condition is stable now.

10:27.752 --> 10:29.462
Don't worry, he's going to be all right.

10:30.254 --> 10:32.048
Go home, it's getting late.

10:34.884 --> 10:38.095
We can stay.
We're all Si-eun's good friends.

10:38.888 --> 10:40.014
No.

10:42.058 --> 10:43.601
That's not what I meant.

10:46.646 --> 10:48.064
I want you all

10:49.982 --> 10:51.942
to leave my son alone.

10:55.821 --> 10:57.239
Please.

11:13.339 --> 11:14.965
There's a sheet

11:16.384 --> 11:17.426
missing.

11:20.054 --> 11:21.514
I'll go get it from them.

11:31.232 --> 11:32.233
By the way…

11:34.151 --> 11:36.237
how did Park Hu-min end up at Daesung?

11:42.201 --> 11:44.245
Do I really need to explain?

11:57.967 --> 12:01.178
Get out, you goddamn fuckers.

12:05.307 --> 12:07.393
Hey!
Hurry and find those assholes.

12:08.352 --> 12:09.270
Yes.

12:10.104 --> 12:12.440
Hurry the fuck up!
Fucking idiots.

12:36.213 --> 12:37.298
Come and eat.

12:42.678 --> 12:45.639
You came home,
you might as well eat something, you punk.

12:53.898 --> 12:54.774
Here.

12:59.153 --> 13:00.237
Mmm.

13:11.749 --> 13:13.000
USE THIS

13:13.083 --> 13:16.170
I won't ask
how or where you got this. Give it back.

13:17.379 --> 13:19.465
Stop acting like you're the grown-up here.

13:25.221 --> 13:26.055
By the way,

13:27.348 --> 13:29.308
a couple of your friends stopped by.

13:33.103 --> 13:36.732
One of those brats looked me
right in the eyes and insulted me.

13:37.858 --> 13:40.986
That punk kid was a smart-ass.

13:43.447 --> 13:47.034
Still, you're a better person than me.

13:48.035 --> 13:50.788
You have caring friends
that come check on you.

13:54.250 --> 13:57.211
Be good to them, kid.
Those are friends for life.

14:00.506 --> 14:01.799
It was the guilt.

14:04.093 --> 14:05.010
What?

14:08.931 --> 14:09.974
He…

14:15.396 --> 14:17.356
Because of me, Si-eun…

14:25.990 --> 14:27.658
It's all my fault.

15:04.445 --> 15:06.447
Si-eun, if you were me,

15:08.282 --> 15:09.867
what would you do?

15:16.290 --> 15:20.294
So you're saying
this is an account for stolen motorcycles?

15:22.087 --> 15:25.174
Do you have evidence of this person
receiving money from these buyers?

15:25.841 --> 15:27.676
No, I don't have that.

15:29.011 --> 15:29.929
Aah.

15:30.888 --> 15:34.600
Well, in that case, I can't investigate.

15:36.393 --> 15:39.813
In the meantime,
we can hold on to this for you, here.

15:40.397 --> 15:42.107
Why don't you head on home for now?

15:42.191 --> 15:45.903
- If anything comes up in the future--
- Never mind. I'm sorry to bother you.

15:50.199 --> 15:51.241
Huh.

16:02.628 --> 16:04.546
Fucking shit.

16:08.342 --> 16:09.551
Hello, friend.

16:11.929 --> 16:14.098
You visited the cops?

16:17.518 --> 16:19.520
You stole the buyers list from us.

16:37.705 --> 16:39.415
Baek-jin-a.

16:39.498 --> 16:40.874
I burned the list.

16:43.961 --> 16:44.962
Take it.

16:52.845 --> 16:54.888
You didn't take
a picture of it, did you?

16:58.350 --> 16:59.643
How did you know?

17:03.313 --> 17:04.481
I don't get it.

17:07.735 --> 17:11.363
You really thought a little shit like you
could do something to stop us?

17:12.489 --> 17:14.450
And that list?

17:15.743 --> 17:18.620
There isn't anything you can do
with that piece of paper.

17:20.956 --> 17:23.292
Then why are you so anxious?

17:26.462 --> 17:28.672
- What?
- Park Hu-min.

17:29.506 --> 17:30.716
Yeon Si-eun.

17:31.842 --> 17:33.343
Go Hyun-tak.

17:35.345 --> 17:37.514
Leave my friends alone.

17:40.601 --> 17:42.352
And I'll delete the photo.

17:48.192 --> 17:49.526
Do what you want.

17:50.861 --> 17:52.404
You'll die over there today.

17:58.494 --> 18:00.287
Ugh, this asshole.

18:00.370 --> 18:02.289
You think you fucking did something?

18:05.334 --> 18:07.294
- He did this to himself.
- Asshole.

18:07.377 --> 18:10.047
- Kick harder. Step on him!
- Asshole.

18:10.130 --> 18:11.965
Try to get clever again,
you fucking prick.

18:12.049 --> 18:14.093
He rolled up
like a little pill bug.

18:14.176 --> 18:16.053
- Kick harder.
- You stupid little bitch!

18:16.136 --> 18:17.721
- Right, bro?
- Kick harder!

18:17.805 --> 18:19.848
- Stupid.
- He's just lying there

18:19.932 --> 18:20.974
Dipshit!

18:22.017 --> 18:23.435
Look. Take care of him.

18:23.519 --> 18:24.895
- Jump in.
- Should I?

18:24.978 --> 18:26.563
Sit down!

18:26.647 --> 18:28.107
We got it. Calm down.

18:28.190 --> 18:29.858
- What more do you want?
- Fuck you!

18:30.567 --> 18:33.195
Shut up. You're being too fucking loud.

18:34.571 --> 18:35.864
I'm trying to sleep.

18:37.282 --> 18:38.283
Who's that?

18:40.160 --> 18:43.038
I thought he left the Union.

18:43.122 --> 18:45.874
Fuck this. Who the hell are you?

18:49.878 --> 18:51.255
Nice to meet you.

18:53.465 --> 18:56.093
I'm Geum Seong-je, motherfuckers.

18:59.221 --> 19:00.347
Hey, Eunjang.

19:03.183 --> 19:04.893
Just do whatever they want.

19:05.519 --> 19:07.437
Otherwise, they'll kill you.

19:09.982 --> 19:10.816
No.

19:12.568 --> 19:13.652
What?

19:16.363 --> 19:18.448
I said no!

19:26.248 --> 19:28.917
You Eunjang shitheads, hmm?

19:29.418 --> 19:31.128
You guys are so much fun.

19:32.588 --> 19:33.672
Okay.

19:35.382 --> 19:36.592
Loyalty passed.

19:43.682 --> 19:45.017
What the fuck?

19:45.517 --> 19:46.935
- Oh fuck.
- Oh shit.

19:47.019 --> 19:48.812
Hey, are you okay?

19:48.896 --> 19:50.439
He's a fucking asshole.

20:08.207 --> 20:09.458
What happened here?

20:11.335 --> 20:12.878
You got here quick.

20:17.841 --> 20:19.176
Come get your friend.

20:24.890 --> 20:26.433
Hey, Jun-tae-ya, Jun-tae-ya.

20:28.018 --> 20:29.394
Hey, can you walk?

20:30.395 --> 20:31.521
Get on my back.

20:43.408 --> 20:45.494
I never thought I'd say this to you,

20:46.453 --> 20:47.496
but thanks.

20:49.915 --> 20:51.959
I don't need your bullshit.

20:55.545 --> 20:57.547
Are you really Eunjang's top dog?

21:00.342 --> 21:03.095
That little loser over there
seemed more like one.

21:04.388 --> 21:08.267
And that kid named Yeon Si-eun
or whatever, from before.

21:10.435 --> 21:11.603
They do.

21:14.398 --> 21:15.399
You're right.

21:16.817 --> 21:17.859
Thanks.

21:21.488 --> 21:22.447
Let's go.

21:29.621 --> 21:32.833
Fuck, man.

21:33.709 --> 21:35.085
It was Seong-je?

21:37.504 --> 21:38.714
Yeah, okay.

21:47.931 --> 21:49.641
Hey there, Baek-jin.

21:51.226 --> 21:52.644
Been eating well?

21:56.690 --> 21:57.983
Why are you here?

21:58.817 --> 21:59.818
Why am I here?

21:59.901 --> 22:02.863
I was just
giving them etiquette lessons.

22:02.946 --> 22:05.824
I mean, when I told these motherfuckers
to bring you here to me,

22:05.907 --> 22:07.784
they stood in my face and asked why.

22:09.453 --> 22:10.746
Oh God!

22:10.829 --> 22:13.832
They told me that I should talk to them
and that you were too busy.

22:15.876 --> 22:19.379
I handled everything, so don't worry.

22:19.463 --> 22:20.589
"Handled"?

22:25.344 --> 22:26.219
Baek-jin-a.

22:27.804 --> 22:29.806
You should've done better to begin with.

22:30.682 --> 22:33.852
How many more times do I have
to deal with the police because of you?

22:37.147 --> 22:40.317
- I'll personally ensure they can't trace--
- You little shit.

22:57.667 --> 22:59.086
My dear Baek-jin…

23:01.004 --> 23:02.589
you act like you're in charge.

23:04.049 --> 23:06.676
Trying to look tough
in front of your boys?

23:09.346 --> 23:11.098
The day I return…

23:12.766 --> 23:14.559
is the day that you die.

23:33.912 --> 23:35.789
Na Baek-jin, that asshole.

23:36.998 --> 23:38.625
He's always crossing the line.

23:39.918 --> 23:41.253
Not cool.

23:42.421 --> 23:45.465
Tak-a, I'm fine.
You can put me down.

23:50.929 --> 23:51.930
You're okay?

23:52.973 --> 23:55.142
- Yeah.
- What the heck happened?

23:56.059 --> 23:57.477
Why would you go there?

23:57.561 --> 23:58.812
I had a page

23:59.729 --> 24:03.066
that I ripped out
of Na Baek-jin's sales list before,

24:04.067 --> 24:05.193
and, uh,

24:05.694 --> 24:09.906
today, I took it to the police station,
but got caught by the Union guys.

24:13.535 --> 24:14.661
I'm sorry.

24:16.204 --> 24:18.582
Sometimes…

24:20.667 --> 24:22.419
you can be a total psycho.

24:22.502 --> 24:24.963
We're all kinda psycho.

24:28.675 --> 24:30.677
And Si-eun's psycho too, right?

24:35.182 --> 24:37.017
What are you talking about, man?

24:38.310 --> 24:40.729
Anyway, let's get you to a doctor.

24:40.812 --> 24:41.938
- Yeah?
- Oh…

24:44.024 --> 24:45.233
It can wait.

24:46.193 --> 24:47.736
I'm really okay.

24:48.612 --> 24:50.947
Let's visit Si-eun at the hospital first.

24:54.201 --> 24:55.285
Hey, Baku!

25:00.415 --> 25:02.417
Hey, bro. Come on, man.

25:04.211 --> 25:05.837
Uh-huh. Let's go.

25:08.590 --> 25:09.799
Hmm.

26:10.735 --> 26:12.571
Hey! Na Baek-jin!

26:14.197 --> 26:15.407
Who's that?

26:16.032 --> 26:17.867
He's looking for Na Baek-jin
in classroom two.

26:18.451 --> 26:19.995
Baek-jin-a!

26:23.665 --> 26:25.959
- What? What's he doing?
- I don't know.

26:28.837 --> 26:30.088
Let's keep it simple.

26:31.006 --> 26:33.592
I'm challenging you to a fight, fucker!

26:36.845 --> 26:37.887
Pick a date!

26:39.848 --> 26:41.933
If Eunjang wins the fight,

26:42.934 --> 26:45.937
then you have to shut down
the entire busted-ass Union.

26:46.021 --> 26:47.439
Understand?

26:48.440 --> 26:50.191
Let's finally end it!

27:07.459 --> 27:08.543
Gotak-a.

27:10.295 --> 27:11.379
Eunjang

27:12.464 --> 27:14.007
is gonna fight the Union.

27:17.636 --> 27:19.137
This is great!

27:19.220 --> 27:20.639
Hey, guys. We're fucking screwed.

27:20.722 --> 27:21.640
- Seriously?
- Why?

27:21.723 --> 27:23.433
- What's going on?
- He's freaking out.

27:23.516 --> 27:27.062
Baku's going up against the Union.
He wants us to fight.

27:27.604 --> 27:31.358
- How do we fight the entire Union?
- What if this makes things worse?

27:31.441 --> 27:32.984
They're fucking insane.

27:33.068 --> 27:34.027
They set a date already.

27:34.110 --> 27:35.820
What the hell did you say?

27:35.904 --> 27:37.697
Everybody's been talking about it.

27:37.781 --> 27:42.160
Baku went to Yeoil High with a megaphone,
calling out Na Baek-jin.

27:42.243 --> 27:44.621
Testing. Ah. Ah. Ah. Hey.

27:44.704 --> 27:45.997
It's me, Gotak.

27:46.623 --> 27:48.249
You all heard the news, right?

27:49.334 --> 27:51.544
Haven't you had enough
of those pricks at the Union

27:51.628 --> 27:54.089
always picking on people
in Eunjang uniforms?

27:57.717 --> 27:58.968
Nice to see you, hyeong.

27:59.052 --> 28:02.597
I'm not the smartest,
but I heard this somewhere.

28:04.766 --> 28:07.185
Newton's whatever says

28:07.268 --> 28:09.646
action's always followed by reaction.

28:11.022 --> 28:12.691
So let's show 'em what we got!

28:14.192 --> 28:17.070
Just this once, help us win this.

28:21.116 --> 28:22.158
Why?

28:23.243 --> 28:24.494
Do you think I'll lose?

28:42.804 --> 28:45.807
EUNJANG HIGH, LET'S GO
BAKU

28:45.890 --> 28:50.645
YEON SI-EUN

28:55.817 --> 28:57.861
About that sense of guilt you mentioned,

28:59.571 --> 29:00.864
I apologize…

29:03.992 --> 29:04.993
to you…

29:07.746 --> 29:09.456
Gotak, and Jun-tae…

29:14.377 --> 29:15.503
and maybe…

29:19.132 --> 29:20.341
even to Baek-jin.

29:26.014 --> 29:26.890
Hey.

29:32.604 --> 29:33.605
Oh.

29:34.230 --> 29:35.273
I'm sorry.

29:40.320 --> 29:41.321
Wait.

29:45.575 --> 29:48.036
I'm sorry about what I said before.

29:50.914 --> 29:52.081
Why don't you come in…

29:54.042 --> 29:55.502
and say hi to Si-eun?

30:09.599 --> 30:10.850
He'll be fine.

30:13.186 --> 30:15.355
The doctor said…

30:15.438 --> 30:17.023
…he's just sleeping right now.

30:19.067 --> 30:20.068
What?

30:21.194 --> 30:23.738
He wasn't hit too hard by the car,

30:23.822 --> 30:27.450
but his nervous system was affected.

30:29.244 --> 30:30.745
So Si-eun's body…

30:32.413 --> 30:34.916
has been taking this opportunity

30:34.999 --> 30:37.293
to make sure he gets fully rested.

30:39.838 --> 30:41.714
He'd been having…

30:42.799 --> 30:45.301
…trouble sleeping for quite a while.

30:47.136 --> 30:47.971
Oh.

30:50.598 --> 30:52.433
They said when he wakes up

30:54.018 --> 30:56.104
is dependent on his own will.

31:03.695 --> 31:05.113
Beom-seok-a.

31:08.324 --> 31:09.576
I have to go.

31:17.458 --> 31:18.877
To those friends?

31:21.129 --> 31:22.797
You'll end up getting hurt again.

31:24.132 --> 31:26.217
- You must've already forgot--
- Beom-seok-a!

31:26.301 --> 31:27.302
Si-eun-a.

31:36.477 --> 31:38.646
Are they more important to you than I am?

31:42.650 --> 31:43.651
Are they?

31:46.237 --> 31:47.238
Tell me.

31:59.542 --> 32:00.835
Beom-seok-a,

32:03.129 --> 32:04.547
I have to go back…

32:07.842 --> 32:09.260
to my friends…

32:11.262 --> 32:12.597
and to Su-ho.

32:55.515 --> 32:58.101
Oh, Si… Si-eun-a!

32:58.184 --> 32:59.727
Si-eun.

33:00.645 --> 33:03.982
Oh, Si-eun-a. Wait.
I'll be right back. I'll bring the doctor.

33:05.358 --> 33:08.903
- Don't move. You can't move yet.
- I have to go.

33:10.905 --> 33:12.949
I have to go to Su-ho.

33:17.078 --> 33:18.579
I have to go.

33:20.873 --> 33:23.042
I have to go to Su-ho.

33:25.920 --> 33:28.548
- Si-eun-a.
- I have to go.

33:28.631 --> 33:29.799
Si-eun-a.

33:32.385 --> 33:33.511
Yeon Si-eun.

33:45.189 --> 33:46.274
He's all right.

33:50.069 --> 33:51.237
Your friend.

33:53.823 --> 33:54.991
He'll be fine.

34:02.331 --> 34:04.000
Su-ho's grandmother,

34:05.835 --> 34:08.004
she kept calling you on your phone,

34:09.047 --> 34:10.381
so I talked to her.

34:12.925 --> 34:14.635
Your friend Su-ho

34:15.344 --> 34:17.346
had an unstable pulse rate,

34:19.599 --> 34:24.187
and the hospital must've called you
because she couldn't pick up her phone.

34:27.023 --> 34:28.775
She said she was sorry

34:29.567 --> 34:31.569
and that he was stable now.

34:32.570 --> 34:34.572
She said not to worry.

35:14.862 --> 35:16.155
Su-ho-ya.

35:28.251 --> 35:30.044
I'm sorry that I'm late.

35:38.594 --> 35:40.596
I'm sorry that I forgot…

35:43.850 --> 35:45.893
everything that you taught me.

35:49.772 --> 35:52.275
How great it is to have friends.

35:53.568 --> 35:55.653
How nice it is to laugh.

36:03.995 --> 36:05.788
What you did for me…

36:13.796 --> 36:16.174
…I want to try doing that for others.

36:50.958 --> 36:53.794
- Si-eun.
- Hey, how do you feel?

36:54.420 --> 36:55.588
Are you okay?

36:58.382 --> 36:59.425
Mm-hmm.

37:00.176 --> 37:01.469
I'm pretty sure.

37:11.312 --> 37:13.689
I thought you…

37:14.774 --> 37:16.442
I thought that you might not…

37:19.820 --> 37:21.280
I'm so glad.

37:24.575 --> 37:26.077
Hey, Jun-tae-ya.

37:26.160 --> 37:28.788
You shouldn't cry over
something like this. Hmm?

37:28.871 --> 37:31.540
Si-eun is finally up,
and everything is all good now.

37:31.624 --> 37:33.918
- Yeah.
- Hmm? You can stop all that.

37:34.001 --> 37:36.379
So no more crying, all right?

37:37.171 --> 37:38.923
Didn't you cry yesterday?

37:41.550 --> 37:42.468
Huh?

37:43.886 --> 37:45.513
Did I?

37:46.722 --> 37:48.224
Oh, no, no, no, no, no!

37:48.724 --> 37:52.228
Hey, I haven't cried since I was
a little boy, back in second grade.

37:52.311 --> 37:54.814
My eyes are just dry. I just, uh…

37:54.897 --> 37:57.650
- I had kept my eyes open for too long.
- Oh, you crybaby.

37:57.733 --> 37:59.110
You ended up crying again?

37:59.694 --> 38:02.113
- I didn't cry.
- Hey, Si-eun-a, don't worry about it.

38:02.196 --> 38:04.615
- He cries all the time.
- I didn't cry, all right?

38:04.699 --> 38:05.741
So, um…

38:08.744 --> 38:09.829
what happened?

38:12.790 --> 38:13.749
With what?

38:20.256 --> 38:21.382
Na Baek-jin.

